sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Domain actor
    participant F as Facade + Outbox
    participant T as Transport
    participant B as Broker

    D->>F: Publish(topic, payload)
    F->>F: assign (epoch, seq) and append to the outbox
    F->>T: Send(PublishRequest, epoch, seq)
    T->>B: PublishRequest(epoch, seq)
    B->>B: seq at or below the last accepted for this epoch? skip it, else accept it
    B-->>T: PublishRequestAck(epoch, seq)
    T-->>F: Acked(epoch, seq)
    F->>F: remove seq and everything before it from the outbox
    F-->>D: PublishAcknowledged (optional receipt)
    Note over F,B: A message leaves the outbox only when the broker acknowledges it.<br/>Writing it to the socket proves nothing.
